      "writtenOn": "2024-09-18T13:54:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m in favor of holding OSC6.x for now and deliver Nova RC1 now.\n\nOSC7.x also changes the default behaviour by calling Nova microversions (latest now) and we also need to make sure everything works fine, because we also found some other problem https://bugs.launchpad.net/nova/+bug/2081023",
      "revId": "af91855c9eab3c9b94b875340faa42bf23e2ebc4",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
