      "writtenOn": "2024-09-18T15:04:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is unfortunate, but python-openstackclient\u0027s 7.x version bump arrived to late in the cycle and blocks nova\u0027s RC1 release. This is not the right solution, but the quickest (and dirtiest) to pin back to pre-7.x version.\n\nI don\u0027t know if this is right to do in requirements repository, so I let requirements core to approve this if acceptable. I only dare to +1 this.",
      "revId": "af91855c9eab3c9b94b875340faa42bf23e2ebc4",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
    },
