      "writtenOn": "2024-09-18T15:07:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We have the 7.1.x line a fair chance but we seem to continue discovering regressions, and we can\u0027t hold up the Nova RC1 any longer without jeopardizing release date, so I support this now. It\u0027s far from ideal but the other options are worse.",
      "revId": "af91855c9eab3c9b94b875340faa42bf23e2ebc4",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
